{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07595","headline":"仰荅韦司业垂访五首 三 · 萧颖士","name":"仰荅韦司业垂访五首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晋代有儒臣，当年富词藻。\n立言寄青史，将以赞王道。\n辽落缅岁时，辛勤历江岛。\n且言风波倦，探涉岂爲宝。\n不遇庾征西，云谁展怀抱。\n士贫乏知己，安得成所好。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧颖士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07595.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07595","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}